MID_MV20_00: <SH>
MID_MV20_00_m001: All troops...charge.
MID_MV20_00_m002: Forward!
MID_MV20_00_m003: (shout exert)
MID_MV20_00_m004: Run them down till their bones are dust!
MID_MV20_00_m005: (shout exert)
MID_MV20_00_m006: (attack exerts)
MID_MV20_00_m007: (shout exert)
MID_MV20_00_m008: (shout exert)
MID_MV20_00_m009: (big throwing exert)
MID_MV20_00_m010: (shout exert)
MID_MV20_00_m011: The queen of Saramis, I presume.
MID_MV20_00_m012: I am Nathan of Arago.
MID_MV20_00_m013: And I am Creek. Your life is ours!
MID_MV20_00_m014: Two of you against one woman?
MID_MV20_00_m015: (attack exert)
MID_MV20_00_m016: In Arago, is this what passes for manners?
MID_MV20_00_m017: (attack exert)
MID_MV20_00_m018: Nice try.
MID_MV20_00_m019: Steel yourself, Nathan.
MID_MV20_00_m020: If we slay their queen, victory for us is assured!
MID_MV20_00_m021: (attack exerts)
MID_MV20_00_m022: (attack exerts)
MID_MV20_00_m023: (attack exerts)
MID_MV20_00_m026: This is bad—we played right into their hand.
MID_MV20_00_m027: Let's drop the charade.
MID_MV20_00_m028: (exert of effort)
MID_MV20_00_m029: Tobias! Bonaventure!
MID_MV20_00_m030: The time is now!
MID_MV20_00_m031: Wha—
MID_MV20_00_m032: What?!
MID_MV20_00_m033: (shout exert)
MID_MV20_00_m034: (shout exert)
MID_MV20_00_m035: War elephants!
MID_MV20_00_m036: BAW HAW HAW HAW!
MID_MV20_00_m037: Yeaaah! Got 'em runnin', boss!
MID_MV20_00_m038: Keep it together, Tobias.
MID_MV20_00_m039: We have but one task here—\nto divide the enemy in two.
MID_MV20_00_m040: Our overwhelming assault will\nsow chaos in the ranks.
MID_MV20_00_m041: (shout exert)
MID_MV20_00_m042: (shout exert)
MID_MV20_00_m043: Then we cut off their vanguard.
MID_MV20_00_m044: Once they're trapped...we crush all who remain.
MID_MV20_00_m045: Yeaaahhh!
MID_MV20_00_m046: The best part of this plan...is we\ndon't gotta hold back at all!
MID_MV20_00_m047: (shout exert)
MID_MV20_00_m048: War elephants! Circle around and take another pass!
MID_MV20_00_m049: They are all enemies! Show no mercy!
MID_MV20_00_m050: We've been had.
MID_MV20_00_m051: The field is lost. We should fall back while we can.
MID_MV20_00_m052: Leaving so soon?
MID_MV20_00_m053: I have a talent for the theater, do I not?
MID_MV20_00_m054: We'll fight another day.
MID_MV20_00_m055: Well played. I always appreciate a worthy adversary.